      "writtenOn": "2026-08-19T15:29:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we remove these local assertions, including the scalar-loop assertion below? `vlib_buffer_enqueue_to_next()` already passes every distinct `next_index` through `vlib_get_next_frame_internal()` and `vlib_node_runtime_get_next_frame()`, which asserts `next_index \u003c n_next_nodes` before indexing the graph arc. That generic enqueue boundary is the appropriate centralized validation point; these checks duplicate the invariant once per packet.",
